msgid ""
"For self-hosted Weblate, a single private repository is often easiest to set "
"up using an HTTPS repository URL with an access token, see :doc:`/admin/code-"
"hosting`."
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "For self-hosted Weblate, accessing repositories on code hosting sites is "
#| "typically done by creating a dedicated user who is associated with a "
#| "Weblate SSH key (see :ref:`weblate-ssh-key`). This way you associate "
